### ==============================================================================
### ToursApp Multi-Tenant Authentication & Real Booking REST Endpoints Collection
### Hosts:
###   - Gujju Tours:   Hostname: www.gujjutours.com,   TenantId: gujjutours,   DB: tours_gujjutours
###   - TripGo Asia:   Hostname: www.tripgoasia.com,   TenantId: tripgoasia,   DB: tours_tripgoasia
###   - Technoheaven:  Hostname: technoheaven.net,     TenantId: technoheaven, DB: tours_technoheaven
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminApiKey = gt_adm_secret_gujjutours_2026_x7k

### ==============================================================================
### 1. GUJJU TOURS AUTHENTICATION FLOW
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Register New Customer on Gujju Tours
# @name registerGujju
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Patel",
  "email": "rahul.traveler@gujjutours.com",
  "phoneCountryCode": "+91",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "password": "Password@1234",
  "confirmPassword": "Password@1234",
  "dietaryPreference": "PureVeg",
  "marketingOptIn": true,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 1.2 Customer Login on Gujju Tours
# @name loginGujju
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours

{
  "email": "rahul.traveler@gujjutours.com",
  "password": "Password@1234"
}

### Store Token Variables
@gujjuToken = {{loginGujju.response.body.data.token}}
@gujjuRefreshToken = {{loginGujju.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### 1.3 Get Current User Profile (GET /me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{gujjuToken}}
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours

### 1.4 Update User Profile (PUT /me)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{gujjuToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours

{
  "fullName": "Rahul K. Patel",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "phoneCountryCode": "+91",
  "dietaryPreference": "Jain",
  "preferredCurrency": "INR",
  "marketingOptIn": true
}

### 1.5 Refresh Customer Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours

{
  "refreshToken": "{{gujjuRefreshToken}}"
}

### 1.6 Request Password Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours

{
  "email": "rahul.traveler@gujjutours.com"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 2. TRIPGO ASIA AUTHENTICATION & MULTI-TENANCY ISOLATION FLOW
### (Demonstrates that the exact same email registers as an independent account)
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Register Exact Same Email on TripGo Asia
# @name registerTripGo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.tripgoasia.com
X-Website-Id: tripgoasia

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Patel",
  "email": "rahul.traveler@gujjutours.com",
  "phoneCountryCode": "+65",
  "phone": "81234567",
  "password": "Password@TripGo2026!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password@TripGo2026!",
  "dietaryPreference": "Halal",
  "marketingOptIn": false,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 2.2 Login on TripGo Asia
# @name loginTripGo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.tripgoasia.com
X-Website-Id: tripgoasia

{
  "email": "rahul.traveler@gujjutours.com",
  "password": "Password@TripGo2026!"
}

@tripgoToken = {{loginTripGo.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.3 Verify Tenant Token Rejection (Gujju token sent to TripGo must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{gujjuToken}}
X-Website-Hostname: www.tripgoasia.com
X-Website-Id: tripgoasia


### ==============================================================================
### 3. TECHNOHEAVEN AUTHENTICATION FLOW
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Register B2B Agent / Customer on Technoheaven
# @name registerTechno
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: technoheaven.net
X-Website-Id: technoheaven

{
  "fullName": "Technoheaven Agent",
  "email": "agent@technoheaven.net",
  "phoneCountryCode": "+971",
  "phone": "501234567",
  "password": "Techno@Heaven2026!",
  "confirmPassword": "Techno@Heaven2026!",
  "dietaryPreference": "None",
  "marketingOptIn": true,
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 3.2 Login on Technoheaven
# @name loginTechno
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: technoheaven.net
X-Website-Id: technoheaven

{
  "email": "agent@technoheaven.net",
  "password": "Techno@Heaven2026!"
}

@technoToken = {{loginTechno.response.body.data.token}}

### 3.3 Get Technoheaven Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{technoToken}}
X-Website-Hostname: technoheaven.net
X-Website-Id: technoheaven


### ==============================================================================
### 4. REAL BOOKINGS PIPELINE (FLIGHT & HOTEL - AUTHENTICATED REQUIRED)
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Real Flight Booking (AeroBharat Express AB-101: DEL -> BOM)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{gujjuToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Website-Hostname: www.gujjutours.com
X-Website-Id: gujjutours
X-Idempotency-Key: FLIGHT-TEST-2026-DEL-BOM-001

{
  "service": "flight",
  "serviceType": "flight",
  "module": "flight",
  "itemId": "1001",
  "flightNumber": "AB-101",
  "slug": "delhi-to-mumbai-flights-del-bom-ab-101",
  "title": "AeroBharat Express AB-101: DEL → BOM",
  "destination": "Mumbai (BOM)",
  "location": "Delhi (DEL)",
  "travelDate": "2026-11-11T06:15:00Z",
  "adults": 1,
  "children": 0,
  "travelers": 1,
  "guestName": "Rahul Patel",
  "email": "rahul.traveler@gujjutours.com",
  "phone": "+91 9876543210",
  "paymentOption": "full",
  "paymentMethod": "upi",
  "specialRequest": "Dietary: PureVeg | Option: Economy Class (Non-stop) | Flight: AB-101",
  "travelersList": [
    {
      "name": "Rahul Patel",
      "type": "Adult",
      "gender": "Male"
    }
  ]
}

